 over the competition will become the Swedish Decathlon Champion 2019. The competitors limit for this event is set to 80. More information about the Swedish Decathlon as well as more information about the competition, payment and registration can be found under the tabs above. Remember that the competition will be run just as any other WCA competition where everyone are welcome to visit and participate. The decathlon challenge is considered to be unofficial.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nV\u00e4lkommen till den 5:e upplagan av Swedish Decatlon Challenge! T\u00e4vlingen f\u00f6ljer samma struktur som under de senaste t\u00e4vlingarna d\u00e4r t\u00e4vlande samlar po\u00e4ng under de tio grenarna. Deltagaren med flest po\u00e4ng efter t\u00e4vlingens slut blir tiokampsm\u00e4stare 2019. Deltagargr\u00e4nsen f\u00f6r denna t\u00e4vling \u00e4r satt till 80. Mer information om t\u00e4vlingen, betalning och registrering finns under flikarna ovan. Kom ih\u00e5g att t\u00e4vlingen kommer att h\u00e5llas precis som vilken annan WCA-t\u00e4vling som helst d\u00e4r alla \u00e4r v\u00e4lkomna att delta eller vara \u00e5sk\u00e5dare. Tiokampsutmaningen anses vara inofficiell.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"SwedishFMCChampionship2022","name":"Swedish FMC Championship 2022","city":"Multiple cities","country":"SE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Anders Berggren}{mailto:aberggren@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Daniel Wallin}{mailto:dwallin@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Viktor Zenk}{mailto:vzenk@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Daniel Wallin}{mailto:dwallin@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{SveKub}{mailto:wcaprofile@svekub.se}] [{Viktor Zenk}{mailto:vzenk@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"[Multiple venues](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/SwedishFMCChampionship2022#21644-tavlingslokaler-locations)","address":"Multiple venues","details":"","coordinates":{"latitude":59.211077,"longitude":17.903231}},"information":"V\u00e4lkommen till Swedish FMC Championship 2022! Grenen 3x3x3 FMC h\u00e5lls inte p\u00e5 [Swedish Championship 2022](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/SwedishChampionship2022) i \u00e5r. Detta inneb\u00e4r att vinnaren av 3x3x3 FMC p\u00e5 denna t\u00e4vling kommer kr\u00f6nas till Svensk M\u00e4stare 2022.\r\n\r\n\u00c4ven om denna t\u00e4vling skiljer sig mycket fr\u00e5n en vanlig kubt\u00e4vling i Sverige s\u00e5 \u00e4r alla som \u00f6nskar varmt v\u00e4lkomna att delta. Det \u00e4r dock extra viktigt att alla deltagare l\u00e4ser all information p\u00e5 denna sida, f\u00f6r att inte missa n\u00e5got g\u00e4llande denna t\u00e4vlings speciella uppl\u00e4gg och regler.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWelcome to the Swedish FMC Championship 2022! The event 3x3x3 FMC is not held at the [Swedish Championship 2022](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/SwedishChampionship2022) this year. This means that the winner of 3x3x3 FMC at this competition will be crowned Swedish Champion 2022.\r\n\r\nAlthough this competition is very different from a regular speedcubing competition in Sweden, everyone who wishes is warmly welcome to participate. However, it is especially important that all participants read all the information on this page, so as not to miss anything regarding the special structure and rules of this competition.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"SwedishFMCChampionship2023","name":"Swedish FMC Championship 2023","city":"Multiple cities","country":"SE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Anders Berggren}{mailto:aberggren@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Daniel Wallin}{mailto:dwallin@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Helmer Ewert}{mailto:hewert@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Leo Lindqvist}{mailto:llindqvist@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Peter Hugosson-Miller}{mailto:phugosson-miller@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Viktor Zenk