ensen@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"L\u00f8jteg\u00e5rdsskolen","address":"L\u00f8jteg\u00e5rdsvej 36, 2770 Kastrup","details":"Festsal","coordinates":{"latitude":55.624013,"longitude":12.620223}},"information":"Dette er den 3. version af T\u00e5rnby Cube Tr\u00e6f. Udover officielle WCA dicsipliner kommer der ogs\u00e5 til at blive afholdt fire uofficielle discipliner: Kilominx, TeamBLD, re-scramble, og dodgeball cubing i l\u00f8bet af weekenden. Det st\u00e5r i tidsskemaet, hvorn\u00e5r de vil foreg\u00e5!\r\n\r\nHvis du tilmelder dig Kilominx p\u00e5 eller f\u00f8r d. 20. oktober vil du modtage en gratis Kilominx fra konkurrencens sponsor, Kube Ninja!\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\nThis is the 3rd edition of T\u00e5rnby Cube Tr\u00e6f. In addition to WCA-reocgnized events, there will also be 4 unofficial events: Kilominx, TeamBLD, re-scramble, and dodgeball cubing at different times in the weekend, see the schedule for when these will be held!\r\n\r\nIf you register for Kilominx on or before October 20th, you will receive a free Kilominx from the competition sponsor, Kube Ninja!","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"TarnovoOpen2022","name":"Tarnovo Open 2022","city":"Veliko Tarnovo","country":"BG","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333oh","444","555","666","777","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Borislav Marchovski}{mailto:bmarchovski@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Mihai C\u0103p\u0103\u0163inescu}{mailto:mcapatinescu@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Plamen Mahladzhanov}{mailto:mahladjanov@abv.bg}] [{Samuil Nikolov}{mailto:samuil_nikolov@abv.bg}] [{Todor Enikov}{mailto:enigma_enikov@abv.bg}]","venue":{"name":"[School \"Emilian Stanev\" - Veliko Tarnovo](https:\/\/em-stanev.org\/)","address":"\u0443\u043b. \u201e\u041c\u0430\u0440\u0438\u044f \u0413\u0430\u0431\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0441\u043a\u0430\u201c 1, \u0412\u0435\u043b\u0438\u043a\u043e \u0422\u044a\u0440\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0