17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333oh","444","555","clock","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Tobias Peter}{mailto:tobias.peter@bluewin.ch}]","organiser":"[{Carlo Glod}{mailto:carlo.glod@gmail.com}] [{Jakob Fiechter}{mailto:jakob.fiechter@gmail.com}] [{Nikolaus Lindinger}{mailto:nikolaus.lindinger@gmx.at}] [{Raphael Riener}{mailto:riener.raphael@gmail.com}] [{Viktor Kalmar}{mailto:viktorcube@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Bisch\u00f6fliches Gymnasium Paulinum","address":"Paulinumweg 1, 6130 Schwaz","details":"Aula","coordinates":{"latitude":47.3349,"longitude":11.7039}},"information":"2019 ist das Jahr in dem Speedcubing Competitions den Westen \u00d6sterreichs erreichen. Nach Vorarlberg gibt es nun auch eine in Tirol!\r\nDurch Tirol zieht sich ein langes Tal, das Inntal, welches das breiteste Tal in Tirol ist, f\u00fcr erste Besucher aber trotzdem eng erscheinen k\u00f6nnte.\r\n\r\nDas Organisationsteam organisiert auch R\u00e4ume in einer Jugendherberge im Nachbargeb\u00e4ude. Bei Interesse, wirf bitte eine Blick in den Travel\/Accomodation Tab!\r\n\r\n______\r\n2019 is the year that Competitions start spreading to the west of Austria. After Vorarlberg, we are happy to announce the first ever Competition in Tirol!\r\nTirol is entirely mountainous with one big valley (the Inn Valley) stretching its entire length. This valley is big for tyrolean standards but for first-time visitors it might just seem tight as well.\r\n\r\nThe organisation team is also organising Rooms in a youth hostel next door. If you are interested in this, take a look at the Travel\/Accomodation tab! ","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"TitanBlindOpen2023","name":"Titan Blind Open 2023","city":"Santiago","country":"CL","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Felipe Andres Rojas Garces}{mailto:fgarces@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Felipe Ignacio Heckersdorf}{mailto:feheckersdorf@gmail.com}] [{Maximiliano Perez Madrid}{mailto:mxpzchess@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Titan 5084","address":"Pje. Titan 5084, Santiago, Estaci\u00f3n Central, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana, Chile","details":"El campeonato se desarrollar\u00e1 en el segundo piso.","coordinates":{"latitude":-33.459486,"longitude":-70.704947}},"information":"**Espa\u00f1ol**\r\n\r\n\u00bfEst\u00e1s preparado para enfrentar el desaf\u00edo y demostrar tus habilidades en este evento \u00fanico? \r\nSi es as\u00ed, no te pierdas la oportunidad de competir. Prep\u00e1rate para sentir la emoci\u00f3n y el estr\u00e9s de resolver el cubo a ciegas, \u00a1Y convi\u00e9rtete en el campe\u00f3n! \r\n\r\n\u00a1Te esperamos en Santiago para un dolor de cabeza de diversi\u00f3n!\r\n\r\n**English**\r\n\r\nAre you ready to face the challenge and show your skills in this unique event?\r\nIf so, don't miss your chance to compete. Get ready to feel the thrill and stress of solving the cube blindfold, and become the champion!\r\n\r\nWe are waiting for you in Santiago for a headache of fun!\r\n\r\n![](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/rails\/active_storage\/blobs\/redirect\/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBbGM3IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--07cf6cc9280b6ab19b9b7fa1ee88926f00d48cf7\/image.png)","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"TitanFMC2023","name":"Titan FMC 2023","city":"Santiago","country":"CL","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Felipe Andres Rojas Garces}{mailto:fgarces@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Felipe Ignacio Heckersdorf}{mailto:feheckersdorf@gmail.com}] [{Maximiliano Perez Madrid}{mailto:mxpzchess@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"Titan 5084","address":"Pje. Titan 5084, Santiago, Estaci\u00f3n Central, Regi\u00f3n Metropolitana, Chile","details":"El campeonato se desarrollar\u00e1 en el segundo piso.","coordinates":{"latitude":-33.459486,"longitude":-70.704947}},"information":"\r\n![](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/rails\/active_storage\/blobs\/redirect\/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb1pCIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--16c17111f94e16ebabc88aca1be85268f8e979fd\/image.png)\r\n\r\n**Espa\u00f1ol**\r\n\r\nEn el Campeonato Titan FMC 2023, el objetivo principal es encontrar la soluci\u00f3n m\u00e1s eficiente al cubo, utilizando la menor cantidad de movimientos posible. Los participantes pondr\u00e1n a prueba su capacidad para visualizar patrones, aplicar algoritmos y tomar decisiones r\u00e1pidas en busca de la soluci\u00f3n \u00f3ptima.\r\n\r\n\u00a1Que comience la competencia!\r\n\r\n**English**\r\n\r\nIn the Titan FMC 2023, the main objective is to find the most efficient solution to the cube, using the fewest possible number of moves. Participants will put their ability to visualize patterns, apply algorithms, and make quick decisions to the test in pursuit of the optimal solution.\r\n\r\nLet the competition begin!\r\n\r\n","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"TizaCubing2023","name":"TizaCubing 2023","city":"Atizap\u00e1n de Zaragoza, Estado de M\u00e9xico","country":"MX","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333","333bf","333mbf","444bf","555bf","clock","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Areli Rub\u00ed Gordillo Mart\u00ednez}{mailto:amartinez@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Rocio Rodriguez Rivera}{mailto:rocio.94@live.com}]","organiser":"[{Ernesto Adrian Romero Caballero}{mailto:ernestobcarmine@gmail.com}] [{Jes\u00fas Fernando Castel\u00e1n G\u00f3mez}{mailto:fercst165@gmail.com}] [{Luis Andrei Castillo Arellano}{mailto:chiandandrei@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"UNITEC campus Atizap\u00e1n","address":"Blvrd Calacoaya 7, La Ermita, 52970 Cd L\u00f3pez Mateos, M\u00e9x.","details":"Auditorio ","coordinates":{"latitude":19.545535,"longitude":-99.241307}},"information":"**\u00a1Bienvenidos a Atizap\u00e1n de Zaragoza! d\u00f3nde se baila y 