:{"name":"Fritidslokalen","address":"M\u00e5nstorpsv\u00e4gen 4, 14645 Tullinge","details":"Enter at M\u00e5nstorpsv\u00e4gen 4, then go down into the basement where you\u00b4ll find the venue: Fritidslokalen","coordinates":{"latitude":59.211082,"longitude":17.903233}},"information":"Welcome to this blind events only competition in Tullinge, just outside Stockholm! We will only have blindsolving events at this competition. However, registration is free and the time-limits are lenient, so we would like to see many of you gathered for this competition in April! \r\n\r\nPlease read through all the tabs on this page to get all the information you need for this competition. The main event of this competition is **3x3x3 Blindfolded**. If you have any further questions, feel free to contact the organizers using the contact information on this page. \r\n\r\nWe are not allowed to wear outside shoes inside the venue, and the floor tend to get a bit cold as it is in a basement. Therefore, a good tip is to bring some slippers or inside shoes to keep your feet warm during the day.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\nVarmt v\u00e4lkomna till denna t\u00e4vling med bara blindgrenar i Tullinge, strax utanf\u00f6r Stockholm! Vi kommer bara ha blindgrenar p\u00e5 denna t\u00e4vling. Det \u00e4r dock gratis att delta och alla time-limits \u00e4r gener\u00f6st satta, s\u00e5 vi hoppas se m\u00e5nga av er p\u00e5 denna t\u00e4vling i april!\r\n\r\nL\u00e4s igenom alla flikar p\u00e5 denna sida f\u00f6r att f\u00e5 all information om denna t\u00e4vling. T\u00e4vlingens huvudgren \u00e4r **3x3x3 med \u00d6gonbindel** Om du har ytterligare fr\u00e5gor s\u00e5 g\u00e5r det bra att kontakta arrang\u00f6rerna genom kontaktinformationen p\u00e5 denna sida.\r\n\r\nDet \u00e4r inte till\u00e5tet att ha p\u00e5 sig utomhusskor inne i t\u00e4vlingslokalen och golvet tenderar och bli ganska kallt d\u00e5 lokalen ligger i en k\u00e4llare. D\u00e4rf\u00f6r \u00e4r ett bra tips att ta med er ett par innetofflor eller inomhusskor f\u00f6r att h\u00e5lla era f\u00f6tter varma under t\u00e4vlingen. ","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"TulungagungMiniCompetition2017","name":"Tulungagung Mini Competition 2017","city":"Tulungagung, East Java","country":"ID","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","444","555","pyram","skewb"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Cendy Cahyo Rahmat}{mailto:crahmat@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Novianto Pambudi}{mailto:otn.ivon@gmail.com}]","organiser":"[{Ilham Fikriya Darmawan}{mailto:spyd.ilham@gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"SMA Negeri 1 Kedungwaru","address":"Jl. Dr. Wahidin Sudiro Husodo No.12, Ringinpitu, Kedungwaru, Kabupaten Tulungagung, Jawa Timur 66229","details":"","coordinates":{"latitude":-8.055536,"longitude":111.908189}},"information":"The registration fee for this competition is IDR 50.000 for all events. All payments will be done on the spot. You can contact the organizers for more information.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"TumbaOpen2023","name":"Tumba Open 2023","city":"Tumba","country":"SE","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:37","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:37"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333fm","333oh","555","clock"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Leo Lindqvist}{mailto:llindqvist@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Dante Tellechea Hultmark}{mailto:dantetehu@gmail.com}] [{Laura Dawidiak}{mailto:bartosz.dawidiak@gmail.com}] [{SveKub}{mailto:wcaprofile@svekub.se}]","venue":{"name":"Tumba Gymnasium","address":"Utbildningsv\u00e4gen 2, 147 40 Tumba","details":"Canteen, enter from the main entrance in the southwest corner of the building, close to Tumbascenen","coordinates":{"latitude":59.201885,"longitude":17.836212}},"information":"Varmt v\u00e4lkommen till Tumba Open 2023! L\u00e4s g\u00e4rna igenom alla flikar p\u00e5 denna sida s\u00e5 du inte missar n\u00e5gon viktig information.\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nWelcome to Tumba Open 2023! Please read through all the tabs on this page so you don't